# This branch (paper-dev) only tracks The_Pienza_Papers/. Ignore everything
# else at the repo root so leftover untracked content from other branches
# (observatory/, data/, secrets/, etc., all live on disk but not on this
# branch's tree) doesn't clutter git status or risk getting added by accident.
/*
!/The_Pienza_Papers/
!/.gitignore
!/README.md

# All LaTeX build output (aux/log/bbl/pdf/etc.) goes into build/ per
# The_Pienza_Papers/.latexmkrc ($out_dir). The canonical PDF is the
# differently-named The_Pienza_Papers.pdf, so this doesn't touch it.
The_Pienza_Papers/build/

# Safety net in case something compiles without picking up .latexmkrc
*.aux
*.bbl
*.bcf
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.log
*.out
*.run.xml
*.toc
*.synctex.gz
*.nav
*.snm
*.vrb
